    <content type="xhtml"><div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><img src="https://cdn1.epicgames.com/spt-assets/69576a28f7154fe9a0dce97508da5163/firestone-online-idle-rpg-1inmf.jpg" /><ul><li><b>Offer valid from:</b> 2026-11-26 16:00</li><li><b>Offer valid to:</b> 2026-12-03 16:00</li><p>About the game (<b>Firestone: Idle Clicker Online RPG</b>*):</p><ul><li><b>Ratings:</b> <a href="https://www.igdb.com/games/firestone-idle-clicker-online-rpg">IGDB User 47% (7 sources)</a></li><li><b>Release date:</b> 2019-05-09</li><li><b>Description:</b> Firestone is a free-to-play fantasy idle RPG set in Alandria. Players assemble a formation of up to five heroes with different combat roles and abilities, upgrade their equipment, and battle waves of enemies and bosses. Guardians support the party, while automatic battles and offline rewards allow progression between sessions.
Progression systems include research, equipment improvements, and war machines. Players can choose between idle combat and active use of abilities, join guilds for shared activities and expeditions, and compete in war-machine battles.</li><li><b>Genres:</b> Casual, Indie, RPG, Free To Play</li></ul><p>* Any information about the offer is automatically grabbed and may in rare cases not match the correct game.</p></ul><p>Claim it now for free on <a href="https://store.epicgames.com/en-US/p/firestone-online-idle-rpg-bfd04b">Epic Games</a>.</p><p><small>Source: Epic Games, Seen first: 2026-11-26 16:05:05, Generated by <a href="https://github.com/eikowagenknecht/lootscraper">LootScraper</a></small></p></div></content>
